---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import Card from "astro-theme-anu/components/Card.astro";
import CardGrid from "astro-theme-anu/components/CardGrid.astro";
import heroImg from "../assets/images/louis-reed-747404-unsplash.jpg";
---

<SiteLayout title="Home">
  <h1>(dis)connecting together</h1>
  <h2>IoT@BIT China Study Tour 2018</h2>

  <Image src={heroImg} alt="Laptop & microcontroller" style="width:100%;" />

  <p>
    In this course students headed to Beijing in November/December 2018 to study
    at the <a href="http://english.bit.edu.cn/">Beijing Institute of Technology</a>
    (BIT) on the topic <em>The Internet of Things</em> (IoT). Over the
    (Australian) summer they:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>learned</strong> about low-cost, network-connected embedded computing devices and their relationship to the broader computing landscape</li>
    <li><strong>built</strong> a prototype IoT artefact exploring the theme <em>(dis)connecting together</em></li>
    <li><strong>exhibited</strong> the artefact in the <em>(dis)connecting together</em> design showcase held on-campus at the ANU in February 2019</li>
    <li><strong>released</strong> the source code, parts list and build instructions for the artefact on GitHub</li>
    <li><strong>reflected</strong> on the design, security, social and ethical challenges associated with the Internet of Things</li>
  </ul>

  <CardGrid columns={3}>
    <Card title="Blog" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}blog/`}>
      <p>Weekly design blog posts from all 19 student authors.</p>
    </Card>
    <Card title="Deliverables" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}deliverables/`}>
      <p>Course assignments and assessment details.</p>
    </Card>
    <Card title="Resources" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}resources/`}>
      <p>Useful links and reference materials.</p>
    </Card>
  </CardGrid>
</SiteLayout>
